ikely pass unless they have a bomb), and let my teammate play out their remaining cards. The landlord has 5 cards — if my teammate can go out now, we win. Playing low (♦7) risks giving the landlord an easy win.\n\n**Answer:** {"cards": ["RedJoker"]}'}
